{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1790758129","published":"2026-09-30T08:49:00Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:43.917100989Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-61915"],"summary":"cyrus-imapd: Fix of CVE-2026-61915","details":"- fix CVE-2026-61915: double-free in the CalDAV VPATCH BYPARAM selector,\n  reachable by an authenticated calendar user patching a resource with two or\n  more properties of the matched kind\n- do not free VPATCH parameters already removed by reference: the parameter\n  stays owned by libical after icalproperty_remove_parameter_by_ref(), so the\n  following icalparameter_free() double-freed it and aborted the CalDAV worker\n  on any VPATCH carrying a PATCH-ACTION parameter\n- use strcmpsafe/strncmpsafe for PATCHACTION string matching:\n  icalparameter_get_xvalue() and icalproperty_get_value_as_string() may return\n  NULL on the same VPATCH path\n- disable the cassandane test runner by default: on i686 its noarch perl\n  dependencies are absent from the i686 mirror of centos8.4-Devel, and on x86_64\n  the prebuilt imaptest helper dies on SIGBUS (769 run, 0 failures, 64 errors,\n  all the same crash); the cunit suite continues to run on both architectures","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cyrus-imapd","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.4","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/cyrus-imapd?distro=centos-8.4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.7-20.el8_4.1.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.4els/CLSA-2026-1790758129.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cyrus-imapd-devel","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.4","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/cyrus-imapd-devel?distro=centos-8.4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.7-20.el8_4.1.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.4els/CLSA-2026-1790758129.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cyrus-imapd-doc-extra","ecosystem":"TuxC